# Harness CLI version pins — the single source of truth for which agent-harness releases Eden
# runs. Read by every consumer so a given agent run is reproducible:
#   - the devcontainer post-create installs these EXACT versions (no implicit "latest");
#   - the agent-pod image (apps/agent-runtime, Milestone B) bakes the same pins;
#   - CI installs them and runs the per-adapter conformance + live gated tests against them.
#
# Bumping a pin is a GATED event, never silent: the adapter conformance + live tests MUST pass
# against the new version before the bump PR merges (ADR-0021). A scheduled CI job watches
# upstream and opens that PR automatically when a newer release appears.
#
# Format: shell-sourceable `KEY=value`, no spaces around '=', exact versions (no ranges).
# Bun is intentionally NOT here — it is baked into the base image, so its one home is the
# `BUN_VERSION` ARG in .devcontainer/base/Dockerfile (the agent-pod image inherits it FROM base).

# Claude Code — installed via the official installer: `install.sh <version>`.
# Upstream: https://claude.ai/install.sh   (channel: stable)
CLAUDE_CODE_VERSION=2.1.212

# Oh My Pi (omp) — npm: @oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent. CLI shebang is `#!/usr/bin/env bun`.
# Upstream: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent
OMP_VERSION=17.2.5

# Codex — npm: @openai/codex.
# Upstream: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@openai/codex
CODEX_VERSION=0.146.0
